# sweep: --bare
# A reader that has never been paired opens on the pairing steps.
wait-for Pair with your computer
expect kobo sidekick init
expect kobo sidekick run
expect Enter the address
clean
shot first-run
# Pads pushed while Deck sits on this page show as a preview when it comes back.
companion deck push --sim --home apps/deck/fixtures/two-pages
lifecycle background
lifecycle foreground
wait-for Preview only. Pair to run commands.
clean
shot first-run-after-push
wait-for Test
expect Deploy
